fitlink (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of FitLink Qt 6 companion for 0xFEEA BLE watches.
  * Supports FEEA V1 and V2 BLE protocol framing over BlueZ (amd64 & arm64).
  * Includes Linux D-Bus notification mirroring, time sync, scheduled alerts,
    battery monitoring, device info, and Find Watch controls.

 -- FitLink Maintainers <maintainers@fitlink.local>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
